---
/**
 * Terminal — a static shell mockup with real-looking Mission OS
 * commands. Non-interactive; every command shown here is a real
 * Mission OS system utility documented in the case study or planned
 * for the ISO. Note at the bottom is explicit about the concept-demo
 * scope so nobody thinks they can actually type here.
 */
---
<div class="term-root">
  <div class="term-frame" role="img" aria-label="Mission OS terminal session — static example, not interactive">
    <p class="term-header">Konsole · p4inz@mission-os · ~</p>

    <div class="term-scroll">
      <p><span class="term-prompt">p4inz@mission-os</span><span class="term-arrow">$</span> mission-status</p>
      <p class="term-out">
        <span class="term-ok">●</span> privacy-first &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <span class="term-ok">●</span> security-conscious &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <span class="term-ok">●</span> portable-first &nbsp;·&nbsp;
        <span class="term-ok">●</span> offline-first
      </p>

      <p><span class="term-prompt">p4inz@mission-os</span><span class="term-arrow">$</span> mission-audit encryption</p>
      <p class="term-out">
        LUKS2 · slot 0 · Argon2id · verified 2h ago<br />
        secure-boot: enabled &nbsp;·&nbsp; tpm-sealed: off &nbsp;·&nbsp; recovery-key: escrowed
      </p>

      <p><span class="term-prompt">p4inz@mission-os</span><span class="term-arrow">$</span> mission-privacy status</p>
      <p class="term-out">
        telemetry: not-compiled &nbsp;·&nbsp; error-reporting: off &nbsp;·&nbsp; usage-stats: off<br />
        firefox: hardened &nbsp;·&nbsp; tor-browser: preinstalled &nbsp;·&nbsp; dns: over-https
      </p>

      <p><span class="term-prompt">p4inz@mission-os</span><span class="term-arrow">$</span> mission-net status</p>
      <p class="term-out">
        radios: off (offline-first policy)<br />
        wg0: down &nbsp;·&nbsp; tor: standby &nbsp;·&nbsp; dns-cache: 0 entries
      </p>

      <p><span class="term-prompt">p4inz@mission-os</span><span class="term-arrow">$</span> mission-store list --installed</p>
      <p class="term-out">
        firefox-esr &nbsp;·&nbsp; tor-browser &nbsp;·&nbsp; keepassxc &nbsp;·&nbsp; gnupg2<br />
        onionshare &nbsp;·&nbsp; mat2 &nbsp;·&nbsp; veracrypt &nbsp;·&nbsp; wireguard-tools
      </p>

      <p><span class="term-prompt">p4inz@mission-os</span><span class="term-arrow">$</span> mission-update check</p>
      <p class="term-out">
        checking signed manifest at updates.mission-os.dev …<br />
        <span class="term-ok">●</span> system:  up to date (0.1.0)<br />
        <span class="term-ok">●</span> browser: up to date<br />
        <span class="term-ok">●</span> mission-store: up to date
      </p>

      <p><span class="term-prompt">p4inz@mission-os</span><span class="term-arrow">$</span> <span class="term-caret">_</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="term-note">
    Not runnable here — this is a concept demo. Every command shown (<code>mission-status</code>, <code>mission-audit</code>, <code>mission-privacy</code>, <code>mission-net</code>, <code>mission-store</code>, <code>mission-update</code>) is a real Mission OS system utility planned for the shipping ISO.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .term-root { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--sp-4); }
  .term-frame {
    background: #04010c;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .term-header {
    padding: 6px var(--sp-4);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-eyebrow);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .term-scroll {
    padding: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .term-scroll p + p { margin-top: 2px; }
  .term-prompt { color: var(--purple-bright); }
  .term-arrow { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 6px; }
  .term-out { color: var(--muted); padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(232,225,208,0.05); }
  .term-out:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
  .term-ok { color: var(--green); font-size: 10px; margin-right: 2px; }
  .term-caret {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--purple-bright);
    color: transparent;
    width: 7px;
    animation: term-blink 1.1s steps(2, start) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes term-blink { 50% { background: transparent; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .term-caret { animation: none; background: var(--purple-bright); }
  }

  .term-note {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: var(--sp-3);
    border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .term-note code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--purple-bright);
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--purple) 8%, transparent);
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
</style>
